        "527d5d76-273d-47d9-9d95-bebe9a1e06c1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Welcome to the future of beauty and business growth! Introducing the MyoLift Facial Bar – your salon's secret to success. With the MyoLift Facial Bar, you can unlock new revenue streams, diversify your treatments, and leave your customers satisfied. It’s quick, easy, and low cost way to have add a revenue generating service to your spa!"
          }
        },
        "e51e9259-1487-4458-8555-3cf18377ca6a": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "The MyoLift™ QT Facial Bar is a self-serve kiosk where customers can tone and lift their face using the MyoLift™ QT and accessories. The Facial Bar comes with a mirror and touch screen that allows you to do follow-along facial treatments. Conductive gel and masks are provided, makingit easy for customers to experience a real microcurrent treatment. This self-serve unit is designed to transform your salon into a thriving beauty hub. "
          }
        },
        "88dfc6e1-c9b8-4d5d-9a6d-26c03b23785b": {
          "type": "custom",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h3>Conductive Gloves<\/h3><p>(can be used with all MyoLift™  Devices)<\/p>\n<p>Microcurrent gloves are an accessory designed to be used as an alternative to traditional ball tip probes for a microcurrent facial treatment. They are an ideal way to provide a more detail oriented microcurrent treatment to fit you or your client's unique needs for facial lifting and toning.<\/p>\n<h4>What makes conductive gloves unique?<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>It is an effective way to erase and eliminate wrinkles and fine lines.<\/li>\n<li>It is a comfortable alternative to traditional ball tip probes or cotton tip probes.<\/li>\n<li>A more detail-oriented way to achieve a toned facelift or even just a cheek lift.<\/li>\n<li>Made from 100% threaded silver.<\/li>\n<li>Antimicrobial, these gloves are more targeted toward reducing wrinkles and fine lines.<\/br>\nThese conductive gloves allow the microcurrent intensity to be controlled by individual pressure. <\/li>\n<\/ul>"
          }
        },
        "c470f05f-1b5f-4fc2-8e60-fc45d6f483ed": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "content": "<p>Ingredients: Aqua (Filtered) Water, Organic Vegetable Glycerin, Hyaluronic Acid, L-Ascorbic Acid (Vitamin C), Organic Aloe Barbadensis (Aloe Vera) Leaf Extract, Organic Camella Sinensis (White Tea) Leaf Extract, Ubiquinone, CoQ10, Tocopherol Acetate (Vitamin E) Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Citrus) Peel Oil, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Benzoate.<\/p><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "66232a31-cb5f-4a67-97cf-d0377bb2fac6": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "How To Use",
            "content": "<ul><li>Cleanse the skin​<\/li><li>Perform exfoliation of your choice (optional)​<\/li><li>Apply conductivity gel​<\/li><li>Perform microcurrent treatment ​<\/li><li>Remove gel with warm towel​<\/li><li>Apply ReVital C serum​<\/li><li>Finish with a moisturizer<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping information",
            "content": "<p>Free USA Ground shipment, Orders are processed within 2 business day. <\/p><p>International Orders Ships within 3 business day.  <\/p><p>International customers are required to pay Duty with their local custom agency. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
